  "value": {
   "primary": "Target-copy payloads: activate Zevlor ({2}, {T}), then cast an instant or sorcery that targets one opponent or their permanent, and it's copied for each other opponent. The deck runs single-target theft, draw and control spells (Cruel Ultimatum, Praetor's Grasp, Bribery, Acquire, River's Rebuke, Leadership Vacuum) that become table-wide.",
   "secondary": "Activation support (Training Grounds, Omen Hawker, Illusionist's Bracers, Pemmin's Aura, Patriar's Seal, Minamo, Twinning Staff) and magecraft engines that trigger on copies (Sedgemoor Witch, Storm-Kiln Artist)."
